{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfe1 Home Deco Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Home Deco Puzzles</strong> combines the calming charm of miniature interior design with a clever memory-based puzzle experience. Unpack, decorate, and relax \u2014 one room at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 MEMORIZE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a good look! Each room is fully furnished for a brief moment. Try to memorize the position of every item based on its surroundings and the subtle differences between similar objects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 UNPACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly, everything is packed into boxes. Your task now is to unpack and return each item to its original location \u2014 but be careful, not everything is where you think it was!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude91 DECORATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recreate the room by placing items back into their correct positions. Can you restore the room perfectly from memory, or will you rely on logic and visual cues?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>60 handcrafted levels</strong> across a wide range of cozy environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Four unique room types</strong>: Small Rooms, Double Rooms, Penthouse Apartments, and Studio Lofts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 <strong>Various themes</strong> including Living Rooms, Coffee Shops, Modern Lofts, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Hint system</strong> \u2013 replay the original layout if you're stuck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Daily rewards</strong> \u2013 come back every day for bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccb <strong>Daily quests</strong> to keep the challenge fresh and rewarding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Peaceful and relaxing soundtrack</strong> for a mindful experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd8\u200d\u2642\ufe0f A <strong>meditative blend</strong> of memory, logic, and decoration mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6a <strong>Easy to pick up</strong>, fun for all ages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a puzzle enthusiast or simply looking for a relaxing way to spend your time, <strong>Home Deco Puzzles</strong> offers a soothing and satisfying experience. Perfect for short sessions or long playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you recreate the perfect room from memory?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One Completed Room","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2099050/c62c0fbd57df9d19a63dac633002e1cd582cb209.jpg"},{"name":"12 Completed Rooms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2099050/234af5d903e0b2e5dec84cbd1f6f9341284c5ecc.jpg"},{"name":"24 Completed Rooms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2099050/d946cea0ddfc8f5007c181fad738ef6259950916.jpg"},{"name":"36 Completed Rooms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2099050/f208ddad0c44995c7f83276ea2d2d66ee6eac2fa.jpg"},{"name":"48 Completed Rooms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2099050/b24acf04dfaf47a3c66fd132a9d4b2a0ae2009d1.jpg"},{"name":"12 Completed Rooms with 2 Stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2099050/3625870f6c142a16930c8f97b2008d6f0e00260a.jpg"},{"name":"24 Completed Rooms with 2 Stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2099050/757e03d844f1c1e6faf1c27a56f823fa8ac54c4c.jpg"},{"name":"36 Completed Rooms with 2 Stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2099050/22dac9da95129e55420f88a